# Agent gotchas — {{PRODUCT}}

Environment notes that used to bloat `AGENTS.md`. Keep secrets out.
If a gotcha is fixed, delete the row. Do not leave historical traps as current guidance.

## Local environment

| Trap | What happens | What to do |
|---|---|---|
| {{LOCAL_TRAP}} | {{LOCAL_EFFECT}} | {{LOCAL_FIX}} |

Examples of rows that belong here: missing gitignored local secrets, Node/Python
version skew vs CI, optional services that skip tests when unset.

## CI and validators

| Trap | What happens | What to do |
|---|---|---|
| {{CI_TRAP}} | {{CI_EFFECT}} | {{CI_FIX}} |

Watch for suites that skip in CI while passing locally, workflows that only run
on `main` (stacked PRs stay unvalidated), and pins that clone another repo at a
stale commit so new fixtures never run.

If a check looks green-but-inert, follow `AGENTS.md` **Escalation**. Do not
patch the test to match the broken path.

## Measurement traps

| Looks like | Actually is |
